Third-party notes

The value-noise helper in src/ink-post.js (fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(127.1, 311.7))) * 43758.5453) and its
bilinear smooth interpolation) is a widely shared public-domain style shader snippet; no other code was copied.
The sRGB transfer constants in src/palette-blend.js are the standard sRGB curve (as used by three.js, MIT).
